==Battleground==
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Collect the [[Treasure]]s from [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3 and bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

